@startuml
title Actual Python module dependencies (IMPLEMENTED)
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "app.py" as App
component "src.fow_combat.view" as View
component "src.fow_combat.controller" as Controller
component "src.fow_combat.model" as Model
package "src.fow_combat.domain" {
  component "domain.__init__" as DomainInit
  component "domain.inputs" as Inputs
  component "domain.to_hit" as ToHit
  component "domain.firepower" as Firepower
  component "domain.dice" as Dice
}
component "Streamlit" as Streamlit
component "NumPy" as NumPy

App --> Controller : imports calculate
App --> View : imports render_inputs/render_results
App --> Streamlit : title
View --> Model : CombatInput / CombatResult
View --> Streamlit : widgets and layout
View --> NumPy : arrays and summary stats
Controller --> Model : types + simulate
Model --> NumPy : random draws and arrays
DomainInit --> Inputs
DomainInit --> ToHit
DomainInit --> Firepower
DomainInit --> Dice
Inputs --> ToHit
Inputs --> Firepower

note bottom of DomainInit
No import edge connects the current legacy MVC
simulation path to domain input types.
There are no implemented service, V4 calculation,
or adapter modules in src/fow_combat.
end note
@enduml
